[I] A modular and extensible wayland compositor

[T] Wayfire is a 3D Wayland compositor, inspired by Compiz and based on
[T] wlroots. It aims to create a customizable, extendable and lightweight
[T] environment without sacrificing its appearance.

[U] https://wayfire.org/

[A] Iliya Bozhinov
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/x11

[L] MIT
